      "statement": "Chrome is MV3 with a service-worker background, chrome.* namespace, action, host_permissions granted at install, and real badge color APIs; Safari is MV2 with a non-persistent background, browser.* namespace, browser_action, required *://*/* permission, and no-op badge color methods.",
