      "id": "claim_09e19c47584f4323a94909c53307f88a",
      "statement": "ADR 0050 made the Safari background page non-persistent (persistent: false) for iOS/iPadOS App Store validation; durable config lives in browser.storage.local while WebSocket/timers/controller are volatile; ADR 0051 splits Safari build output into dist-ios (persistent false) and dist-macos (persistent true) from one iOS-safe source manifest.",
