      "statement": "Both extensions implement a TabListerAdapter (tabLister) that queries all tabs via tabs.query({}), filters to isRegularPageUrl, and maps to TabInfo; tabId targeting is stateless and per-call, threading through readActiveTabPage/performActiveTabAction/performActiveTabBatch via an optional tabId that skips active-tab resolution.",
