    {
      "id": "claim_26a1fcf0d6da4b819c2ff3aaf8abc16d",
      "statement": "The tab indicator (ADR 0060) prepends '● ' to document.title with a MutationObserver re-applying it, plus a persistent blue (#1a56db) in-page banner (#brijio-tab-indicator, role=status, aria-live=polite); indicator state persists on globalThis.__brijioIndicatorStates with a 60s inactivity timer, and re-show resets the timer instead of recreating the indicator to avoid flicker on executeScript re-injection. This is pure DOM and identical on Chrome and Safari.",
