      "id": "claim_1c825d3024694fae858fbc19121c9a87",
      "statement": "ADR 0043 makes content-script injection idempotent: the background calls scripting.executeScript before every tabs.sendMessage (to load latest code), and the content script replaces its previous onMessage listener via globalThis.__brijioOnMessageListener and its pageshow listener via globalThis.__brijioPageShowListener so at most one listener is active and pageContextVersion stays consistent across re-injections.",
